Halfling's incredible luck always kicks in at just the right moment to save their skin.

Whenever you take [14%, 13%, 12%, 11%, 10% (TL1-5)] or more of your life from a single attack, you gain 50% Evasion and [0, 0, 7, 20, 41 (LUCK 10-100; DEX 10-100)] additional defense for the next [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] turns. The defense increases based on your luck and other defensive stats.
